# Ze AI Reference
# Generated from code -- always matches this binary.

## Sections (use 'ze help ai <section>' for details)

  cli       CLI subcommands: ze bgp, ze config, ze show, ze signal, ...
  api       Daemon API: all RPC commands, update syntax, families, plugins
  mcp       MCP tools: ze_execute, ze_reference, ze_announce, ze_withdraw
  dispatch  Dispatch keys for daemon commands
  all       Everything

  101 plugins, 19 address families
  153 YANG RPCs, 390 builtin RPCs
  MCP tools: ze_execute, ze_reference (handcrafted) + per-group tools auto-generated from the YANG command registry

## Quick Start

  Daemon:  ze start --mcp 9718 config.conf
  Or:      ze --mcp 9718 -
  CLI:     ze cli
  Show:    ze show <command>
  Help:    ze help ai all
